From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: setavenger <github@snblago.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:36:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] friglet: hook the bonus script into menus, provisioning
 and system scripts

bonus.friglet.sh installs friglet (BlindBit Silent Payments scanner with an
Electrum server for one wallet) from a pinned, checksummed release tarball.
This wires it in like the other bonus apps:

- _provision_.sh: re-run 'on' after an SD card update or recovery
- 00settingsMenuServices.sh: on/off in SERVICES (asks whether to keep data)
- 00mainMenu.sh, 99connectMenu.sh: open the friglet SSH menu
- 99updateMenu.sh: install the version pinned in the script
- 00infoBlitz.sh: scan progress line until friglet is up to date
- blitz.debug.sh: unit and script status only; journal lines are left out
  because friglet logs wallet txids and amounts
- blitz.shutdown.sh: stop friglet cleanly before power off
- tor.network.sh: recreate the onion service when Tor is switched on

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
